- <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">(explain viewpoint concept)
- responsive design(media queries)
- syntax:
 @media(condition){
// css rules goes here
}
e.g. @media(max-width: 600px){
    body{
        background-color:pink;
    }
}
- mobile(600px or less)
- tablet(601px-900px)
- desktop(above 900px)
